mcp-server-aha-aql (0.24.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Translation of the specification aha-aql 0.24.0
    (spec sha256 caab507ed82ebcb6a9f2c7ea6c55bfadfed1208642edbdd0229d95aee417348e).
  * The trust store of the platform on macOS (keychain) and Windows
    (certificate store of the system) is documented; SSL_CERT_FILE and
    SSL_CERT_DIR have an effect on Linux only.
  * Tests that need the fake Aha! account are skipped on macOS and
    Windows; the binary is mcp-server-aha-aql.exe on Windows.

